__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log
.DS_Store

# §181 clause 4: guard-mutation control logs are EVIDENCE, not output. `*.log`
# above silently dropped every one of them -- the WA-03 defect exactly: the
# controls really ran, the logs really existed, and nothing shipped, so on the
# artifact alone genuine controls were indistinguishable from controls that
# never ran. A reviewer must be able to reach these from a clean clone.
!vp/guard-controls/**/*.log
